    "answer": {
      "short": "Writing $A=\\angle OAB$ and $B=\\angle OBA$, the dot product gives $|\\underset{\\sim}{a}||\\underset{\\sim}{u}|(\\cos A-\\cos B)=0$. Thus $\\cos A=\\cos B$, so $A=B$.",
      "worked": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p25-q15-answer",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let triangle OAB be isosceles with OA = OB. Write ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "A=\\angle OAB,\\quad B=\\angle OBA,\\quad \\underset{\\sim}{a}=\\overrightarrow{AO},\\quad \\underset{\\sim}{b}=\\overrightarrow{OB},\\quad \\underset{\\sim}{u}=\\overrightarrow{AB}.",
                "display": false
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p25-q15-answer-sum",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Then ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\underset{\\sim}{u}=\\underset{\\sim}{a}+\\underset{\\sim}{b}.",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Using the geometric dot product formula,",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p25-q15-answer-equations",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{aligned}|\\underset{\\sim}{a}||\\underset{\\sim}{u}|\\cos A&=\\underset{\\sim}{a}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{u}\\\\&=\\underset{\\sim}{a}\\cdot(\\underset{\\sim}{a}+\\underset{\\sim}{b})\\\\&=\\underset{\\sim}{a}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{a}+\\underset{\\sim}{a}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{b},\\\\|\\underset{\\sim}{b}||\\underset{\\sim}{u}|\\cos B&=\\underset{\\sim}{b}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{u}\\\\&=\\underset{\\sim}{b}\\cdot(\\underset{\\sim}{a}+\\underset{\\sim}{b})\\\\&=\\underset{\\sim}{b}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{a}+\\underset{\\sim}{b}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{b}.\\end{aligned}",
                "display": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p25-q15-answer-subtraction",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Subtracting, using ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "|\\underset{\\sim}{a}|=|\\underset{\\sim}{b}|,\\quad \\underset{\\sim}{a}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{a}=\\underset{\\sim}{b}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{b}",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " and commutativity of the dot product,",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p25-q15-answer-result",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "|\\underset{\\sim}{u}||\\underset{\\sim}{a}|(\\cos A-\\cos B)=0.",
                "display": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p25-q15-answer-conclusion",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Both magnitudes are nonzero, so ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\cos A=\\cos B.",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " Hence A = B because cosine is one-to-one on ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "[0,\\pi].",
                "display": false
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
